        <p>
          A critical divergence between Cohere Rerank 3 and BGE-Reranker-Large is their respective input token limit. While bi-encoders produce a single vector regardless of chunk size, cross-encoders must ingest the query string and document chunk simultaneously within their attention context window:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-purple-500/30 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
